{"step_index":21,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-31T14:42:12Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-31T22:42:12+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-08-31T22:42:17+08:00\nThe search for \"JetBrains AI Assistant Trust Center legal terms privacy\" returned the following summary:\nJetBrains provides comprehensive information regarding the privacy, security, and legal terms for its AI Assistant through its official **Trust Center** and legal documentation portal[1][2].\n\n### **Key Privacy & Security Information**\n*   **Data Usage for Training:** JetBrains explicitly states that they **do not use customer data (inputs, code, or outputs) to train their AI models**[3][4]. They also work only with Large Language Model (LLM) service providers that adhere to the same standard[4].\n*   **Data Collection & Retention:** If you choose to enable \"detailed code-related data\" collection (which is configurable), your inputs and responses may be stored on JetBrains servers for a limited period, **not exceeding 30 days**[3][5]. This data is used solely to improve the product and is not shared with third parties or used for model training[3][5].\n*   **On-Premises/Local Options:** For organizations concerned about cloud data transmission, JetBrains offers **AI Enterprise** solutions, including on-premises LLM installations, which allow you to use AI features without sending code to the cloud[3][5]. Additionally, newer versions of the IDE support an \"Offline mode\" to block cloud model calls[4].\n*   **Compliance:** JetBrains maintains transparency regarding its security practices, including **SOC 2 Type II** and **GDPR compliance**[1][2].\n\n### **Legal Terms**\n*   **Terms of Service:** The legal relationship and usage conditions for the AI Assistant are governed by the **JetBrains AI Terms of Service**[6][7]. These terms cover usage rights, intellectual property, and service limitations[8][9][10].\n*   **Acceptable Use Policy:** Users must comply with the [JetBrains Acceptable Use Policy](https://www.jetbrains.com/legal/docs/terms/jetbrains-ai/acceptable-use/), which outlines prohibited activities and sector-specific restrictions[11][12].\n*   **Territorial Restrictions:** Use of AI-powered features may be restricted in certain locations due to constraints imposed by AI service providers[12].\n\n### **How to Access Further Details**\n*   **JetBrains Trust Center:** Visit the [JetBrains Trust Center](https://www.jetbrains.com/trust-center/) for detailed reports on infrastructure security, privacy procedures, and compliance certifications[1][2].\n*   **Legal Documentation:** All formal legal agreements, including the Privacy Notice and Terms of Service, are available on the [JetBrains Legal Information page](https://www.jetbrains.com/legal/)[13][14].\n*   **Direct Inquiries:** For specific security or compliance questions, you can contact **security-compliance@jetbrains.com** or **privacy@jetbrains.com**[1][15].\n\nSources:\n[1] [jetbrains.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGdP_uZE2UTA00aSXG7quktLet2bWuwSvmRMqihSnL0szcKKr60rC6XeoiH5kvcu2M4MdGBNhfDDktau4ogMTxYbMZq6VUgEIdpSnuTwQ4u058FQSPPmjzorS1D8Y7S7TvlRxuVA8atNDHaV8-A3oM=)\n[2] [jetbrains.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGO5ymF5PTgcD5JaIVdJ-XLcTcZUz1JHFuWwEZAycOwnNOaONsitWQKI6xujK0TpmrzEOfsQmv7RT6luVjy7byWjRkTihHC43RBYWnUhj9SipMBKkEBXjDv)\n[3] [jetbrains.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFiDC_AtI41n12aPaTaSiOFB_nYce7KRNACRXb7A2qedzKBbLH1LKnWGXTJ_loEjJsWrfmQ4Ex5stxTcg_XdjAX0n-Q_5B9WypR0VPQuP1Ei_gzj9O4oIflnZWsPIc1hzF7_C2J3RFJb70hhsfdDK19wqtO_ops4NSzW8pR823PsBxqs2K3CZBA-FEwt7WR252fyWOnvMDevhX97Ct2DS6uiKYLOelHiizxKd1SRfW_B0tWfHqMROEdlS-D4cfpwC8IYCKT-Ax_QuVg0pofuKp9jocf1LMK400O)\n[4] [jetbrains.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFutJIRZbsM0Moo3niWfPQlH76O4KU_Z3IZLPwPjd5zWqZ_xWj5jpy6fZeBCRt4BO-Yy6GSVVW-5U2_nPlm6yIxyN9En